    "directions": [
      "In a chopper, add tomatoes, salt to taste, curd, coriander stems and grind it coarsely.",
      "Transfer it to a bowl and keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a bowl, add chicken, salt to taste, degi red chili powder, turmeric powder, curd, oil and mix it well.",
      "Keep it aside to marinate for 10-15 minutes.",
      "In a mortar pestle, add ginger, garlic, green chillies, salt to taste and grind it coarsely.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a handi or saucepot, add oil, ghee, once it's hot, add cinnamon stick, cloves, green cardamom and let it splutter.",
      "Add prepared ginger garlic paste, onions and sautÃ© it well until golden in color on medium flame.",
      "Add degi red chili powder, turmeric powder, coriander powder and sautÃ© it for 2-3 minutes.",
      "Add prepared tomato paste, salt to taste, sugar and cook well for a while.",
      "Add marinated chicken and sautÃ© it for a minute.",
      "Add water, cover it with the lid and cook it for 20-25 minutes until cooked well.",
      "Finish it with some coriander leaves and mix it well.",
      "Transfer it to a serving bowl or dish and garnish it with coriander sprig.",
      "Serve hot with roti or rice."
    ],
